Origin (azsupport/ports): CPython gh-134100, the cherry-pick of 4e9005d to 3.13 (GH-134172), as Gentoo carries it on 3.12.16 (gentoo/cpython gentoo-3.12.16, 2472cf49aa31ff9413f637f761036dc4db78aed5); upstream 3.12 has no fix. PyImport_ImportModuleLevelObject() formatted its error message from a name it had released already when the parent module of a relative import was not in sys.modules (a use-after-free on an error path).

diff --git a/Lib/test/test_importlib/import_/test_relative_imports.py b/Lib/test/test_importlib/import_/test_relative_imports.py
